  "findings": [
    "A1SB calls PhoenixShot; A1SC calls PhoenixFlamestrike. Tooltip descriptions are swapped and numeric claims differ.",
    "Phoenix auto orders prefer damaged unit i; attacker bV is only the elseif fallback. No fallback after a failed preferred order.",
    "Circle starts angle10 at0.02; stops before angle360, normally35 moves through350degrees; center is forward from original caster by max(300,targetDistance).",
    "Each first-hit enemy takes75 and creates a fixed225radius 10damage persecond zone for7ticks, with attack=true on both direct and periodic BJ damage.",
    "Four e01G created, no JW/JH registration or native summon-flag change; orbit radius200, rotating -1.8degrees on non-dispatch timer callbacks; initial angles are -360/-270/-180/-90, while later rotation uses +360/+270/+180/+90.",
    "Timer evaluation count dispatches first remaining alive slot at integer seconds1/2/3/4, with5second timeout before dispatch; rotation counter excludes dispatch callbacks.",
    "Feathers move1nativeunit every.02 then check strict distance<50;102single-target damage precedes KillUnit and ShowUnit(false).",
    "Widget death clears still-orbiting feathers; ordinary unit death of caster, target or feather hides the chasing feather without automatically killing it.",
    "e01G has Aloc,60HP,-1HPregen; no explicit spd/weapsOn, generic fighter defaults are not evidence."
  ],
  "partialBoundaries": [
    "Native ANcl delay/channel/same-frame order arbitration and target legality inherited from native defaults.",
    "Web terrain and player-rectangle mapping; native SetUnitPosition collision and enumeration.",
    "Native float/evaluation counting and cross-trigger ordering during a coarse host frame.",
    "Auxiliaries retain handles outside army groups; hidden/Aloc native lifecycle and creation hooks not fully verified.",
    "Retained removed-caster ownership during burning zones and original model/effect assets."
  ]
